{"availability":"available","full":"vhscom/private-landing","name":"private-landing","description":"🔐 Learn authentication by building it right. An extensible, standards-compliant reference implementation for Cloudflare Workers with Hono, Turso, PBKDF2, and JWT dual-token sessions.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":79,"forks":3,"created":"2025-01-08T14:36:59Z","updated":"2026-05-11T05:15:34Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://private-landing.vhsdev.workers.dev","topics":["authentication","cloudflare-worker","educational","hono","jwt","nist","owasp","pbkdf2","reference-implementation","security","session-management","turso","typescript"],"demo":"https://private-landing.vhsdev.workers.dev/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.567Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.567Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.567Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:28.567Z","stars":79,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Demo note: The login endpoint is protected by adaptive PoW challenges — repeated failures return increasing proof-of-work difficulty. Cache-backed rate limiting is implemented and tested but not currently enabled on the live demo; flip createCacheClient in app.ts to activate it.","A from-scratch authentication reference implementation for Cloudflare Workers — PBKDF2 password hashing, JWT dual-token sessions, constant-time comparison, sliding expiration, and a removable observability plugin — all wired together with Hono, Turso (with optional Valkey/Redis caching), and strict TypeScript.","Every design choice traces back to a standard: NIST SP 800-63B for credentials, NIST SP 800-132 for key derivation, OWASP ASVS for verification, and RFC 8725 for JWT best practices."],"features":["NIST + OWASP + RFC references throughout — learn the why behind each decision","630+ tests including attack-vector suites (token tampering, algorithm confusi